    <detaileddescription>
<para>Statistics for staged RaBitQ distance evaluation.</para>
<para>These counters belong to the quantizer rather than to a particular ANN graph. They are currently populated by <ref refid="structfaiss_1_1HNSW" kindref="compound">HNSW</ref>&apos;s staged search path. </para>
